\title{Themes}
\tag{discrete}

\p{In one sense, this course is something of a grab bag of topics: we will cover introductions to logic and proof, set theory, relations and functions, induction, number theory, and a bit of combinatorics.  Each topic could be an entire course in and of itself.  But there will be several themes running throughout the semester that will unify our study:

\ul{
  \li{[Types](002B)}
  \li{[[004C]]}
  \li{[[002E]]}
  \li{Algebraic structures}
}

}
